# Investax Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit reports completed by Softstack for Investax.

Investax is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token and issuance infrastructure smart contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Investax  
Audit type: Token and primary issuer smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

